      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "None of the character sketches you provided hit the most clichéd tropes. Marcus, Hana, Jace, and Elena all come across as well-different individuals with specific attributes that do not encapsulate overly clichéd archetypes. Marcus feels more at home in a polished, high-society drama due to his calm demeanor and business background. Jace, with his street-smart demeanor, situates well in a gritty crime/street drama. Hana, characterized by her brilliance and quiet nature, could work in various genres but her methodical and composed trait leans slightly towards a high-society drama. Elena’s refined manners and family background give her a strong presence in polished melodramas or drama centered around power and politics.",
